<section class="legal-page narrow">
<p class="eyebrow">ORDERING INFORMATION</p><h1>Simple terms for placing an order</h1>
<p>Product availability and stock are checked again when checkout is submitted. A saved order reserves the purchased quantity in the website inventory.</p>
<h2>Payment</h2><p>Cash is recorded at collection. Bank-transfer and M-PAiSA references are customer-submitted claims until the owner verifies the actual received payment. When online payment is enabled, the website records Paid only after provider confirmation.</p>
<h2>Collection</h2><p>Your requested collection date/time is a preference until the owner confirms it. Do not travel for collection until the confirmed details appear on your receipt or are communicated by the business.</p>
<h2>Cancellations and refunds</h2><p>Cancelling an uncompleted order restores reserved website stock once. If a cancelled order was already paid, any real-world refund must be confirmed before the payment record becomes Refunded.</p>
<h2>Ingredients and allergens</h2><p>Read the product information and contact the owner before ordering if you have an allergy or need ingredient clarification. The chatbot must not be treated as an allergy guarantee.</p>
<h2>Reviews</h2><p>Product reviews require a completed purchase made through a customer account. One editable review is allowed per customer and product.</p>
